stack's contents decide is counted in neither tally.  Zero-initialising ib (filed) would make the variant deterministically
green.  Green, eleven: arm (d) or the checkstop fallback edited (D6, D9, D10, V4, V5, V6) -- MEASURED unreached on pmppc (the
window sweep below); arm (b) edited (D11, V2) -- with the aligned compare arm (b) is taken only when the translation moved pc to
